<title>UK: Denmark sets 500 mln mark December 2003 bond.</title>
<headline>Denmark sets 500 mln mark December 2003 bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced</p>
<p>by lead manager Deutsche Morgan Grenfell.</p>
<p> BORROWER   DENMARK</p>
<p> AMT    500 MLN DEM   COUPON     5.00	MATURITY    15.DEC.03</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  101.745   PAY DATE   S13.JUN.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  2.125     REOFFER    99.895    SPREAD	+5 BP</p>
<p> NOTES	S-SHORT FIRST COUPON</p>
<p> MOODY	AA+	 LISTING    FFT	 PAY FREQ    =</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  AA1	 DENOMS (K) 1-10-100  SALE LIMITS UK</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  NO	  FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    GERMANY   HOME CTRY  DENMARK   TAX PROVS   =</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.275     SELL CONC  1.85	PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p>UNDERLYING GOVT BOND SEPTEMBER 2003 BUND</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
